sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant F as MarketDataFetcher
  participant S as StorageBackend
  participant E as SignalEngine
  participant Q as Feature / quality pipeline
  participant M as HMM + XGBoost models
  participant R as Risk gates / sizing
  participant X as Paper or live executor
  participant D as Audit / EventBus
  O->>F: fetch or refresh OHLCV / order book
  F->>S: persist bars
  O->>E: tick(symbol, timeframe)
  E->>S: load recent bars / metrics / outcomes
  E->>Q: build aligned features and check data quality
  Q-->>E: ordered, sufficiently fresh features or abstention
  E->>M: regime + directional probability + meta-label
  M-->>E: probabilities and regime snapshot
  E->>R: candidate signal, costs, account/trade context
  R-->>E: first failing gate OR permitted position size
  E-->>O: SignalResult with reason and audit context
  alt signal permitted
    O->>X: submit order intent with execution mode policy
    X-->>O: order state / fills / exchange rejection
  else blocked or no signal
    O->>S: record missed-trade / regime / decision where applicable
  end
  O->>D: decision, order, lifecycle and metric events
  D-->>S: persisted audit/history where wired
  D-->>O: event-driven listeners / WebSocket fanout
